=2 Walkthrough
* Speak to {p:Nanaa Mihgo} in {z:Windurst Woods} (J-3) to begin.
** She'll mention the last signature on the {@k} {k:signed envelope|Signed envelope} was a single letter and ask you what it was. The multiple choice answers are:
*** T
*** A
*** **V** (The correct answer)
*** I...forget.
** It likely doesn't matter overall what you respond with, but the correct answer is **V** as per the text of the key item of the last mission (__"I agree to all of the above. Signed, V."__)
** At the end of the cutscene you will receive three key items: {@k} {k:Gang whereabouts note}, {@k} {k:First forged envelope}, and {@k} {k:Second forged envelope}.
* Optional: Speak to {n:Cha Lebagta} and {n:Bopa Greso} who are just south of {p:Nanaa Mihgo} at J-4 for a couple clues.

=4 First Envelope
!Sauromugue Champaign-map.jpg|right|Sauromugue Champaign
* Head to {z:Sauromugue Champaign} and check the **???**s in the following locations to attempt to spawn {m:Climbpix Highrise}. The tower that spawns {m:Climbpix Highrise} is random, so just check them all until he appears.
** You will know you're checking the correct locations if you receive the message: __It is impossible to climb this wall with your bare hands.__
* There are 6 towers in all that are represented by dark dots on the {z:Sauromugue Champaign} map. Their locations are:
** G-6
** G/H-8
** I/J-7
** J/K-8
** K-9
** I-9/10 - Can only be reached the following ways:
*** {z:Sauromugue Champaign}'s {p:Survival Guide} teleportation.
*** {p:Voidwatch} warp takes you to the correct location - the first tier of White Stratum Abyssite is required.
*** Use the {p:Cavernous Maw} in {z:Sauromugue Champaign (S)}.
*** Go through {z:Garlaige Citadel}, passing through the third **Banishing Gate** and exiting into {z:Sauromugue Champaign}.
* {m:Climbpix Highrise} drops a {p:Grapnel}. This is needed for the next part of the quest.
* Next, go to the tower at I/J-7 and take off **all** your equipment.
* Trade your {p:Grapnel} to the **???** and watch the cutscene to get your {@k} {k:First signed forged envelope}.

=4 Second Envelope
* Go to {z:Lower Jeuno} (H-10) and talk to {n:Sniggnix} (in the back hallway at Muckvix's Junk Shop). You have to beat him at a game of dice.
* Keep rolling against him until you beat him.
* Head to {z:Dangruf Wadi} to gamble against 3 more Goblins. You have to beat them all in order.
** Each time you roll against a Goblin you have to give them their favorite item. Once you've rolled, win or lose, the item is gone.
** You do not have to beat them consecutively. If you lose, trade the item again: there is no need to return to a previous goblin.
** Expect to lose to each goblin at least once. See: {@i:Goblin Die|568} {i:Goblin Dice|Goblin Die|568}.
*** Due to a quality of life update from 2016, the dice game difficulty will now be reduced after you've lost.[1]

!Dangruf Wadi-map1.jpg|right|Dangruf Wadi
* Here are the Goblins' locations and items:
** **First:** Saltvix
*** **Item:** {i:Rock Salt|Rock Salt|936}
*** **Location:** The **???** in the western part of the room at G-7 (technically the ??? is in F-7)
** **Second:** Grasswix
*** **Item:** {i:Gausebit Grass|Gausebit Grass|534}
*** **Location:** The **???** at F-4/5 where the underground tunnel comes out
** **Third:** Eggblix
*** **Item:** {i:Lizard Egg|Lizard Egg|4362}
*** **Location:** Go to the area that spans across F-11 and G-11 and go all the way west. There is a hidden cave at F-11 - just walk through the wall. Follow the tunnel until you reach a hole in the floor. Drop down this hole and head south to the corner at E-12. This is where the **???** for the last goblin is.
* Go to these **???** in order and trade each one their respective item. Then roll against them. If you lose, you need to trade another of their favorite item.
* After winning all three games, head to J-3 in {z:Dangruf Wadi}. Ride the geyser up the cliff and follow the path until you zone out into {z:North Gustaberg}.
** If you have unlocked the {p:Geomagnetic Fount} for {z:North Gustaberg} then warping back to town and using that would be faster.
* Head to the east and follow the river all the way down to the waterfall (stay on the south side of the river).
* You'll find a **???** click on it and spawn {m:Gambilox Wanderling}.
** There is a 3 minute respawn time on {m:Gambilox Wanderling} if needing to spawn for multiple party members.
* After defeating the goblin, click on the **???** again to get a {i:Regal Die|Regal Die|1092} and a cutscene.
** If you lose and die, then if you come back soon then you may find that the **???** just says "It smells like a Goblin..." instead of spawning the enemy - then you just need to wait a few minutes and try again.
* Head back to {z:Lower Jeuno} and trade your {i:Regal Die|Regal Die|1092} to {n:Sniggnix} to get the {@k} {k:Second signed forged envelope}.

* Head back to {z:Windurst Woods} and speak to {p:Nanaa Mihgo} again to get your {i:Rogue's Bonnet|Rogue's Bonnet|12514}!

